From: Robert DeLanghe <1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:02:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(convo): file-change keys are relative to the working
 directory, one key per file (pr/67)

normalize_artifact_path files a change under the path relative to the session's
cwd (macOS /private/var and /var are one), so one file is one key. Snapshots and
examples re-recorded; round-trip pins and qualifier anchors need the dev shell.
